data: {"type":"response.completed","response":{"id":"resp_067b756b377f97050069e16f9b54a08190b78ecc1e9f974922","object":"response","created_at":1776381851,"status":"completed","background":false,"completed_at":1776381865,"error":null,"frequency_penalty":0.0,"incomplete_details":null,"instructions":null,"max_output_tokens":null,"max_tool_calls":null,"model":"gpt-4.1-2025-04-14","output":[{"id":"msg_067b756b377f97050069e16f9c32f081908789d727b300cbf0","type":"message","status":"completed","content":[{"type":"output_text","annotations":[],"logprobs":[],"text":"Deep in the cool hush of a mountain cave, where sunlight barely dared to slip across the rocky threshold, lived an old bear named Bram. The cave yawned open beneath a tangled curtain of ivy, its entrance worn smooth by centuries of paws and rain. Within, shadows claimed every corner, painted in shades of smoky blue and charcoal.\n\nBram’s heavy frame moved with surprising grace over the gritty stone. His shaggy, silver-streaked fur bristled against the chilly air as he ambled to a patch of moss, its green glow an oasis in the gloom. The smell of earth was strong—loamy, damp, and sweet with decay. Water dripped in constant rhythm from the stalactites, making tiny clear pools that caught stray hints of daylight and shimmered like lost jewels.\n\nThe cave was Bram’s fortress—a world of stone arches and hidden nooks. Cracked granite walls were scrawled with ancient claw marks and etched with spidery veins of quartz that gleamed in the dark. In one shadowed corner, a pile of sun-bleached bones spoke of old meals, while a patch of crumpled leaves, twigs, and soft shed fur formed a makeshift bed.\n\nAs Bram settled onto his bedding, the cave pulsed with quiet life. Tiny cave crickets chirped unseen in crevices, and a sleepy bat rustled somewhere overhead. Every sound bounced through the cavern, making the space feel vast but safe. Now and then, a draft of wind brought in the music of the outside world—the hush of pine needles, the echo of a distant owl.\n\nDrowsy and content, Bram stretched, filling the cave with a low, rumbling sigh. Surrounded by ancient stone and the whispers of the wild, he felt rooted and timeless. Here, in his hidden chamber, Bram was both king and keeper of secrets, sheltered by the heart of the mountain itself."}],"role":"assistant"},{"id":"cmp_067b756b377f97050069e16fa9b8408190ab05934212c434a0","type":"compaction","encrypted_content":"gAAAAABp4W-pbABR1r0_f9_dBiUf3_LaibD3KoQgKCrDrOhbVU3zYubetXhjMlXqPGW0FWvj72r9aT0M0Byt_wcxvvrdfrMKVFuxigNmWUX_XO8bbL_aGNxRVj-K6uVmkyNyNbFy3c2IiVEpg62e895z5pGujQrwr650QW0WMy6g7lkJ7MDyhs8UDL72Of9ZXG0lYVO8ExiO-E_vjLaxQPu2eHjJWaTVuAsaqw16uSpgFRTok9Wgacn2NyPAmoL47v3PDN2r0j2OWKr-oE-_dlEFOsSyVOYXfNq4KIXOKfyt2XBx60RlzDbTalh2urJAl_WylCVYfUr8b0Zbf86fGAdqK1KgvnHDj7mym0zQJ126BwG-3A1oiGPXkZw84cPR13Xm5xWPM8O-ISJ7rmB6UBVOELAuZFnUIzWJX5QpT1lNBOfPm2zkyFUx-Z6HYd_z04JEQ2DajShKyoPmN76NIfoZKleUOXOsYQi3haHCrMuw9OaLya42SgbNtcGur1KlOYUdTZ8V7HTmfpn-Jadc5r_evAJ7Nh8ijbnMEvIIwMS762brT2Av5-_fpe9Gc1_A5QuXJvWWO9ClIi9lnDZGosyxCEEhpg-1jC80Zhcdze_fzTcbuAXKcmTLuNQ8BO1rt4SzY8Pi9fKtRr80mYWg4CuVKZ8nq0CoOsBQ6IiXj--4_8LQ7n7_D6Uw_rnT9JwT1jqCDgklI6VJhNMDB2btLLcKro20nsYhcGCiDh5S7aT7NXlVqd73NPTRsA-_IPxIVaB__mgmu_68GVUdep0BcSpoEH-iTqO7Sj-fp7y0QPwrTLFjbsprVzJ2vQsNiOL7yPZRtWF9mMVZHU8L8PV1MMpe2BgwhsvZ3gel53oXwZHmOaT_en8r2ERHTn1od4Xlk9SKATt3r6OIpSTcmjyehFUlPGf8-lqEenEE4nO7xRqA-Nv6m83u0bCLIFbXsKGBsukJnVeF5rL8j0aziRAiivo0LS4m2axmBTL0PCdqqFJmg1Fmvv-HAf5daVrxBwaXt6CWLtllFNJDE-pAieRtrG_PxMHbqQsWV5328Qo9u5MKZ1RLiASNO6Ow_zlHwSr-TXfPSVj0N9m6UDpl-baa4egNVNlCfxMzkwXsy2V5AV36ekqfsAEAPNbS4gkMg0hFjioyVXbIOj3NQ6TgnO7aA1kFM6TG9WqsDIeebtLZRrVEbNIxptFw2oFQyglb1gzplrKDjfRG_TBXhIQ-PZfeXL2EnNCN32MtdKXANrOoeylMjvv4AwBSH6Y9KcKcttBR_LKWJJ8A_vI2H3LOisKhFSbtyqZXvzPSoqe2AvUxleNmHWsrdmSPar0K_Gn5yYmruQ5PN380J7KIYHUQFo_z-6XY9MIqr9pl2WyZTZcPsRXESt7MLgLP6qqtfvCPj7OUx9i3SDtS9zZyjKkd16lzfknXwKajlVGboqyEnSAUYtbMYI_0UDBTpPrdk9d8tdI76C-6zAYUWlU_r96yFfcjHN3lcCNgcm1Kzjh5BPJwydi3TkAU0TFRGnaPKP6x5H8HsbwADZQBb3Boq822